[*]
[*] GTKWave save — conv_interface AXI4-Lite + AXI4-Stream
[*] ECE 410/510 M2 — open with: gtkwave sim/waveform.vcd sim/interface.gtkw
[*]
[*] Signal order follows data flow:
[*]   1. Clock / Reset
[*]   2. AXI4-Lite Write channel  (AW → W → B)   — Tests 1 and 4
[*]   3. AXI4-Lite Read  channel  (AR → R)        — Test 2
[*]   4. AXI4-Stream               (TVALID/TREADY) — Test 3
[*]   5. Core outputs               (start / tile_len / result) — visible effect
[*]
